---
import HuntLayout from '../../layouts/HuntLayout.astro';
---

<HuntLayout title="Know Before You Go — Williams Creek Whitetails">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-4 py-12 md:px-6">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-hunt-muted">Williams Creek Whitetails</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-hunt-heading text-4xl text-hunt-cream">Know Before You Go</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-hunt-cream/90">
      We are looking forward to having you join us for your hunt. Here are a few details to help you
      plan for your time.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      <a
        href="/hunt/know-before-you-go.pdf"
        download
        class="hunt-btn inline-flex"
      >
        Download PDF
      </a>
    </p>

    <section class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-hunt-cream/90">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-hunt-heading text-2xl text-hunt-gold">What is the location?</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">1100 Apple Avenue, Cumberland, Iowa</p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We are 4 miles east of Grant, Iowa on a dead-end road. Around the 2nd curve of Apple
          Avenue, you will see a mailbox for our driveway. Drive up the hill and park in front of
          the cabin.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-hunt-heading text-2xl text-hunt-gold">What is the general schedule?</h2>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-hunt-gold-light">Sunday</h3>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>1:00–2:00pm — Arrive and settle in and sign any waivers.</li>
          <li>2:00 — Shoot your bow to make sure it made the trip and is still in tune.</li>
          <li>3:00 — Head to the stand for the first hunt.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-hunt-gold-light">Monday – Friday</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">We will determine the night before when the next morning's hunt will start.</p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold text-hunt-gold-light">Saturday</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">You may hunt in the morning. Checkout by 12 noon.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-hunt-heading text-2xl text-hunt-gold">What about food?</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If you chose the option for us to provide all the meals, we will have 3 meals available
          each day. If you do an all-day sit, we will have your lunch packed for you.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If you are providing the food, there are a few restaurants within 30 minutes. Atlantic is
          the largest town with the most options:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>
            <strong>Atlantic</strong> (30 mins north) — Grocery: Walmart, Hy-Vee, Fairway.
            Restaurants: Azteca, Rancho Grande, Pizza Ranch, and other fast food.
          </li>
          <li><strong>Griswold</strong> (25 mins NW) — Dusty’s Bar and Grill</li>
          <li><strong>Corning</strong> (25 mins south) — Primrose (steak, burgers & seafood)</li>
          <li><strong>Anita</strong> (35 mins NE) — Redwoods (steak, burgers & seafood)</li>
          <li><strong>Wiota</strong> (25 mins north) — Wiota Steakhouse</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-hunt-heading text-2xl text-hunt-gold">What do you provide for gear?</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>Deer stands (hanging, ladder, and blinds)</li>
          <li>All hanging stands have a safety line — you must be hooked in at all times</li>
          <li>Sitting pad loan for ladder stands</li>
          <li>Stands are primarily set up to shoot while sitting</li>
          <li>Shooting lanes trimmed</li>
          <li>Target for practice</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-hunt-heading text-2xl text-hunt-gold">
          What gear do you NOT provide, and should I plan to bring?
        </h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>Safety harness — you must use a quality safety harness</li>
          <li>Bow hanger — strap-on only (no screw-in gear)</li>
          <li>Bow line for raising/lowering your bow (or a sling)</li>
          <li>Range finder</li>
          <li>Calls (grunts, rattles, etc.)</li>
          <li>Lures or urine — not recommended, not prohibited</li>
          <li>Tree saddle if you prefer mobility (we have ~40 pre-set stands/blinds)</li>
          <li>Coolers for meat</li>
          <li>Your own bow setup</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-hunt-heading text-2xl text-hunt-gold">Is there any gear that I cannot use?</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>Anything that screws into trees (e.g. screw-in bow hangers) — protects high-value trees</li>
          <li>Anything the state considers illegal</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-hunt-heading text-2xl text-hunt-gold">What about bait?</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Iowa is a no-bait state, so it is illegal to set out bait like corn piles to hunt over.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-hunt-heading text-2xl text-hunt-gold">
          When I shoot a deer, how do you handle recovery?
        </h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>
            Call us immediately (Chad 712-254-3999 or Lee 712-249-7855). Wait at least 30 minutes
            before following blood trail.
          </li>
          <li>
            If we cannot recover, Iowa allows dogs for recovery. You decide whether to bring a dog
            and pay that cost directly.
          </li>
          <li>
            We bring a loader to the field near the cabin for field dressing (we can assist).
          </li>
          <li>We hang the deer in our shop, weigh, and assist with skinning and butchering.</li>
          <li>Grinding and vacuum sealing available for $150 per deer.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-hunt-heading text-2xl text-hunt-gold">Contact</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>
            Chad:{' '}
            <a href="tel:+17122543999" class="text-hunt-gold underline">712-254-3999</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            Lee:{' '}
            <a href="tel:+17122497855" class="text-hunt-gold underline">712-249-7855</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</HuntLayout>
